f/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162138512,"discussion_id":"877b8a978b918964681d87f308fceffc70026a85","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复Flash Attention算子中KV Prefix功能在特定推理场景下的逻辑缺陷。原实现仅基于`s2LoopCount`与`prefixLoopCount`的简单比较来判断当前循环是否处理前缀数据，未考虑序列分块处理时的起始偏移量`s2StartIdx`。这导致在非零起始索引的推理场景下，前缀循环的判断不准确，可能错误地访问非前缀数据或错误调整索引，影响功能正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`AntiquantKey`和`AntiquantValue`函数中`taskParam.isPrefixLoop`的判断逻辑。将原条件`(runInfo.s2LoopCount < constInfo.prefixLoopCount)`更新为`((runInfo.s2LoopCount + runInfo.s2StartIdx / constInfo.s2BaseSize) < constInfo.prefixLoopCount)`。该方案将起始索引`s2StartIdx`折算为对应的基础块循环次数，并与当前循环计数相加，从而在推理模式下能准确判断当前处理的序列位置是否仍处于前缀数据范围内，确保了KV Prefix功能在分块处理时的正确性。","created_at":"2026-02-03T21:03:13+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-03T21:03:13+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162138533,"discussion_id":"9e425995924803ca0d0cea665dd5dee1788b991e","body":"### 逻辑错误: 在启用KVPrefix功能时，判断是否为前缀循环的条件逻辑存在错误。原始条件`taskParam.isPrefixLoop = (runInfo.s2LoopCount < constInfo.prefixLoopCount)`只考虑了`s2LoopCount`，但未考虑`s2StartIdx`的影响。当`s2StartIdx`不为0时，该条件无法正确判断当前循环是否仍在处理前缀部分。修改后的条件`((runInfo.s2LoopCount + runInfo.s2StartIdx / constInfo.s2BaseSize) < constInfo.prefixLoopCount)`将`s2StartIdx`的影响纳入计算，确保在分块处理时能准确判断是否仍在前缀循环内。\n\n**问题类型**: 逻辑错误\n**文件路径**: `attention/common/op_kernel/arch35/flash_attention_score_antiquant_block_vec.h`\n**行号**: 602\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\ntaskParam.isPrefixLoop = ((runInfo.s2LoopCount + runInfo.s2StartIdx / constInfo.s2BaseSize) < constInfo.prefixLoopCount);\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n修改正确，已修复逻辑错误。建议在相关注释中说明该条件的计算逻辑，以增强代码可读性。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-02-03T21:03:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T15:51:02+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6822c79924adff5452d7b9b8","login":"yang-binrong","object_id":"6822c79924adff5452d7b9b8","name":"yang-binrong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yang-binrong"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":602,"end_new_line":602,"start_old_line":602,"end_old_line":602,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":162220037,"body":"changed this line on [898201d4](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/commits/detail/898201d40171beaf80db8149bcea99124960d683?ref=prefix&prId=1419) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/1419/diffs?diffId=5298017&start_sha=6bb3be651872aaa2d8a719a45af5e56fca5c0188&filePath=attention/common/op_kernel/arch35/flash_attention_score_antiquant_block_vec.h#ac9ca61a726d3682ea170c385a4bb3428356f8c1_602_602)","created_at":"2026-02-04T16:45:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-04T16:45:50+08:00","user":{"id":"6793bc548ad9ff35a220baea","login":"mayday773","object_id":"6793bc548ad9ff35a220baea","name":"mayday773","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fd/cf/51f485d893c72f533740fa822d3638cbe48d9a592841aff3a65401007fdeaaa6.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mayday773"}}]},{"id":162138540,"discussion_id":"287c189c43d239ff472870159fb65904229e57b0","body":"### 逻辑错误: 在`AntiquantValue`函数中，启用KVPrefix功能时判断是否为前缀循环的条件存在同样问题。原始条件`taskParam.isPrefixLoop = (runInfo.s2LoopCount < constInfo.prefixLoopCount)`未考虑`s2StartIdx`的影响，可能导致在分块处理时错误地判断循环阶段。修改后的条件`((runInfo.s2LoopCount + runInfo.s2StartIdx / constInfo.s2BaseSize) < constInfo.prefixLoopCount)`确保了判断的准确性。\n\n**问题类型**: 逻辑错误\n**文件路径**: `attention/co